.
.  Create Postscript files (to be converted to gif)
.  for the Lithographic data.
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
device 3 close
device 3 xxxx
call data.dp
.
thickness 0.2
tic label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
height 4
.
. Starting Step 2.1 - Summary of Response Variable
.
ECHO ON
capture SUMMARY.OUT
summary width
END OF CAPTURE
ECHO OFF
. Finished Step 2.1: Page Back for Output
set ipl1na 4plot.ps
device 2 postscript
tic label size 6
label size 6
title size 6
.
. Starting Step 2.2 - Generate a 4-plot
.
x3label displacement 12
4-plot width
x3label displacement
. Finished Step 2.2: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv 4PLOT.PS 4plot.ps
.
tic label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
.
set ipl1na runseqpl.ps
device 2 postscript
.
. Starting Step 2.3 - Generate a run sequence plot
.
y1label width
x1label sequence
run sequence plot width
. Finished Step 3.1: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv RUNSEQPL.PS runseqpl.ps
.
set ipl1na scatcass.ps
device 2 postscript
.
. Starting Step 3.1 - Generate a scatter plot of response versus
.                     cassette
.
y1label width
x1label cassette
line blank all
character x all
xlimits 0 30
xtic offset 0 1
plot width cassette cassette
line solid all
character blank all
xlimits 
xtic offset
. Finished Step 3.1: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv SCATCASS.PS scatcass.ps
.
set ipl1na boxpcass.ps
device 2 postscript
.
