x1label cassette
line box plot
character box plot
xlimits 0 30
xtic offset 0 1
fences on
box plot width cassette
line solid all
character blank all
xlimits 
xtic offset
. Finished Step 3.2: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv BOXPCASS.PS boxpcass.ps
.
